WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.980
When it's a lucky day with nice weather

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.770
I hope we have a good time together

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:15.620
Today let's keep

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.240
Sharing laughs

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:26.670
You take care of my true wishes in secret

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:34.220
You always cheer me up after bad days

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:40.580
I'm sure everyone has known it since childhood

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:49.250
You pretend you don't care, but you're always a good friend

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:58.650
You have another busy day as a god; you just can't help but help out others

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:04.990
Everyone is cheered up by your love

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:13.300
I love always being together while you help others

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:20.820
I'll protect that precious smile; you know what I mean

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.820
When it's a lucky day with nice weather

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:28.400
We should go visit the shrine together

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:35.300
It's so hot!

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.580
Isn't it supposed to be autumn?!

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:39.300
How come no one is here?

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:42.000
Did they go out to the beach again?

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.490
Am I the only one left behind?!

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:46.560
Meiko?

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:49.310
Mayu!

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:54.690
I can't understand a thing you're saying.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:57.280
Well, come with me.

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:03.490
Nezametsuki Thriller Night

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:08.970
We can do it!

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:10.760
Sure we can...

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:21.090
Isn't the festival tomorrow?

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:24.850
Yes, but the day beforehand will obviously be the busiest.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.700
Follow me. Everyone's over here.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:30.450
Yuzu!

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.280
I brought the plates and sake you wanted!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:35.170
Mayu-sama!

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.950
Thanks for all your hard work.

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:39.950
Oh, did Meiko-san come with you?

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:45.450
Indeed, we met in front of the house and she was drawn, like a moth to a flame, into helping.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:48.710
Meiko-san, an unrefined girl like
you can't help with anything here!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.120
Wow, that was blunt!

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:53.890
Never fear! I have tons of work for everyone to do!

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:57.110
Aren't you looking confident for once, Gonta?

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:00.050
It's the festival of our shrine. Leave everything to me.

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:03.750
I feel like we're the only two doing grunt work.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.650
This is ridiculous.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:12.830
I guess that's it.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.120
My goodness...

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:16.450
Mayu-sama, Mayu-sama, thanks for all the work!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.070
These are for you.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.430
Oh, that's thoughtful of you.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.720
Here you go, Meiko.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.910
This bottle has a strange shape.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.980
The gods are drinking ramune.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.040
You're right.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:31.260
An auspicious event!

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.880
Let's pray.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.190
Mayu-sama, the bottle goes over
there when you're done with it.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.440
See you later!

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.460
There's still a lot more work to do!

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.300
What a slave driver.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.140
He's going overboard.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:47.800
My god.

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:53.130
I was worried when we fell behind with the preparations
because of the rain, but everything is working out just fine!

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:55.850
Maybe it was fine for <i>you !
All you did was order us around!</i>

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.110
Great work today everybody!

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.530
Please help yourself to anything!

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:01.980
I've been waiting for this!

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.860
I was getting so hungry I couldn't even make myself move!

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:10.930
This is absolutely delicious. Yuzu-san, merely tasting the food you cooked is relieving me of my fatigue.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.750
Why do you get to eat first?!

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.710
You can have some too, Mayu.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:17.790
Meiko-san, would you like to rest a bit more?

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.420
Yes...

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.550
I shouldn't have come.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:23.790
I tried to warn you.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:30.430
Though, I <i>am</i> jealous that you got
to be with Mayu-sama all day.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.350
Fluffy floaty!

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:36.850
Good evening!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:39.080
Oh, Yoshino, come on in.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:39.940
This is <i>my  house!</i>

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:43.360
Looks like we made it in time for dinner.

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:44.810
Shamo—

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:45.700
—san.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:48.070
I met her on my way here.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:49.280
Sorry for the intrusion.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:53.410
Whoa, the Goddess of Poverty came to a festival
that's dedicated to wishing for an abundant harvest!

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:57.980
Unlike you guys, I can control my powers.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.040
I-I'm sorry.

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:09.000
This feels great.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.350
That's good to hear.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:13.280
Cows, let's all be lazy cows.

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.140
I can't eat another bite.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.140
This feels so cool.

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:18.830
It's pretty hot for me.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.490
Aren't you guys going home?

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:28.390
Oh, since we'll wake up early tomorrow morning anyways, I'm just going to sleep here tonight.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.520
That's what I was thinking too.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:32.490
You too?

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:38.140
Meiko-san, you should stay here
tonight too! It'll be a fun sleepover!

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.170
I didn't expect this, though.

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:45.130
I've prepared the bath; it's ready whenever you are.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:48.080
The bath... Yuzu-san in the bath?!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.980
Dip all the way to your shoulders and count to 100, Gonta-san.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:53.560
What should I do?

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.720
Oh, Gonta-san turned serious.

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:57.620
He's more serious than ever.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.470
Serious Gonta.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:00.560
Oh no!

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:03.650
I didn't realize my expression was so revealing.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.240
How inept of me, Oomiya-Michinushi-no-Mikoto!

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:07.440
Whose nickname is Gonta!

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.820
Gonta is his real name, too.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:13.800
All right, I won't let anyone find
out my feelings from now on.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:17.160
All right, time to take a bath and
wash away the day's fatigue.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.770
Mayu-sama, let me bathe with you.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.280
I will too!

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:24.240
Come forth, bath and lodging kit!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.210
Your Lucky Mallet is pretty convenient!

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:30.340
I'll be taking a bath too!

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:34.320
Oh, you're all coming with me?

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:39.410
Please be careful, everyone! The bath
room doorknob might be slippery.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:40.640
Slip?!

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:43.360
No way! Yuzu-san's s-slip—

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.740
What should I do?

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:47.860
Gonta, you're making it stifling hot.

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.110
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:57.080
This feels great. It's as if the fatigue from today is escaping my body and flying off elsewhere.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:07:00.110
But it <i>is  a bit cramped with four people.</i>

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:01.580
Next to you, Mayu-sama!

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:02.840
I'm next to you, Mayu.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:04.670
Do you want to play with the rubber duckie?

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:11.670
Settle, my wild spirit.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.130
Gonta-san?

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:21.570
So this is where you were.

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:22.510
Yuzu-san!

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.410
Excuse me for taking a bath before you.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.450
Oh, sure, go ahead.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:31.870
This self-possession, this tranquil mind of mine.

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:35.660
Yuzu, a big lump of shampoo came out.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:36.700
Oh, it's a thick drip.

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:38.140
Drip?!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.160
That's not the right word!

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:40.620
I'm not quite there yet.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.760
I'm turning off the lights.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:02.540
I can't sleep with it being this swelteringly hot.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.430
The fan is broken too.

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:06.650
Let's leave the door open a little bit to let the breeze in.

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:09.140
The moon is out.

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:10.780
Does it feel cooler now?

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:13.250
I don't feel any breeze at all.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.700
The wind chime isn't moving an inch.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.500
I want to sleep next to Mayu.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:20.880
We decided it through rock-paper-scissors, so give up already!

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.350
I heard a creepy voice just now!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:28.260
It is probably Gonta singing or
something. Don't let it bother you.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.400
But I'm scared and getting the chills!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.650
I see! That's it!

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:37.670
That's exactly what we need for a hot night
like this. This is textbook sleepover material!

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:39.620
Let's get Gonta over here and we'll all tell stories.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.090
What kind of stories?

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:41.930
Love stories?

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:46.440
Ghost stories!

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.440
Just what on earth is Mayu thinking?

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:53.400
I told her I need to get up early tomorrow!

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:56.760
I need to go to bed so I can wake
up early tomorrow, jeez!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.450
What do you need, Mayu?

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.060
Oh, you're here, Gonta.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:04.330
Sorry, Gonta-san. Please keep us company for a little while.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:08.790
If it's for you, Yuzu-san, I'm more
than happy to keep you company.

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:11.140
Gonta, we get it, so take the empty seat.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:12.170
Go ahead.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:13.710
An empty seat?

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:17.970
Mayu's next to Yuzu-san, who's next to
Shamo-san, Meiko, Yoshino, Sasana...

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.140
There's no empty seat next to Yuzu-san!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.820
I'll just sit here.

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:24.100
You sound pretty unenthusiastic.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:29.290
Now that we're all here, who's going
to go first? How about you, Sasana?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.090
I'll go a little later.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.070
Who wants to go first?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:34.700
What's that?

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:37.530
All right, why don't you go first, Yoshino?

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:39.110
N-No, I'll pass!

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:43.430
I'm feeling cool enough, so please don't worry about—

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.860
me...

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:47.650
Let me tell you something.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.720
It's scarier to listen than to tell!

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:51.650
I see!

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.750
I get it now! I'll go first!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.590
She's very simple-minded.

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.510
She's the type that's likely to get ripped off.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:05.710
I went through something the other day that scared me at first, but it turned out it was just me.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:07.670
Don't spoil the ending before you begin.

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:12.440
It was the end of spring, and I was
returning home from Yaoyorozu-dou.

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:17.120
I saw many severed heads moving!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.190
It was just you, right?

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:22.200
Yes, they were actually construction workers.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.830
But I was really frightened!

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.790
I was so frightened I shrank back
into a pose like you'd see in a manga!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.640
Yoshino!

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.880
Gasp, shock, squeak!

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:36.340
Mayu-sama!

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:39.700
My bad, Yoshino. Sorry for scaring you so much.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:43.980
Yoshino gets scared the easiest, so go easy on her.

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:46.220
Well, that's good enough for the first story.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:47.580
Now then...

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:52.230
who's next?

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:55.430
This is getting chilly.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.460
Gulp!

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:57.740
I'll go!

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.410
Yuzu-san?!

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:03.910
It's time to tell you that story.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.740
<i>That  story.</i>

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:09.100
Whoa, that sounds scary!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:14.750
The summer's almost over. Did you have a rewarding summer?

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:21.570
This is a true cellphone horror story
that someone I know experienced.

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:29.070
She had a cellphone, but she never
used it much due to her work.

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:36.790
She was bored on the way to visit her parents', so she was killing time on a certain website.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.580
Wh-What kind of site was it?

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:46.400
The first page didn't have any information on it except instructions to go to the next page.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:50.710
She did so and kept opening the next page over and over.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:12:01.070
But her cellphone was on the cheapest default
plan, so her bill was extremely high that month!

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:03.360
Oh, the horror!

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:06.080
That is certainly scary, but that's not
quite what we were looking for, Yuzu.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.200
Are you done with the scary part?

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.940
Oh, it was really scary, Yuzu-san! I almost cried!

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.410
You go next, Meiko.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.720
Leave it to me!

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:22.840
After injuring his knee at the beach, a man went to the
hospital to get an x-ray because the pain wouldn't stop.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.900
It turned out the back of his kneecap
was filled up with acorn barnacles!

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.510
Filled up!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.920
That's just an urban legend!

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.730
Sasana, you go next.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:38.630
In a residential area twenty minutes' walk from
Yaoyozoru-dou, there's a dog that always barks at me!

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:42.960
It frightens me every time and I go into
to a pose you'd see in a classic manga!

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:45.660
Oh, that sounds terrible.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.790
Does no one have a real ghost story to share?

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:51.930
This isn't cooling me off. I'm feeling even hotter than before.

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:53.590
This isn't how it's supposed to be.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:00.720
It seems like they're more or less ready for the festival.

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:05.230
Well then, time to join the party!

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:12.840
This is about a being whose existence itself is a mystery and only gets scarier the more you imagine it.

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:16.090
Oh, a typical modern horror story opening.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:22.750
I have passed through countless towns and have come across many, many beings.

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:26.600
Yet even in my experience, this entity stands out as perplexing.

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.020
Gulp!

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:34.260
I first saw it in a certain town living in a somewhat poor household.

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:37.710
It had already taken root in that house.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:45.040
All it did was eat and sleep, day after day, slowly dwindling the family's budget.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:52.080
Albeit a goddess, this creature did nothing but spend the entire day playing video games.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.290
Is that me? Are you talking about me?

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:58.440
No one can explain how such a goddess exists.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.630
It becomes all the more mysterious and
frightening when you think about it.

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:03.880
That's about me, isn't it?

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:07.190
It's indeed a scary story from Yuzu-san's point of view.

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:09.310
Oh no, I'm doing fine.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:12.140
My identity is—

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:14.810
I'm still here as your fiancée, Mayu-sama!

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:16.070
Wait, Sasana!

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:19.370
They're causing quite a commotion.

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:25.580
None of you understand what a ghost story is!

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:31.190
I've saved the best for last! My story
will freeze you in your tracks!

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:33.770
L-Let me bring my futon.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:35.380
She's already scared.

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:41.860
It was exactly a year ago.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:46.850
Yes, it happened the night before the festival.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:50.540
A cool breeze was blowing that day.

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:58.040
It was the middle of the night, and I was on my way home after being driven to work all day by Gonta.

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:06.370
Amidst the insects' songs, I heard
something splattering in the water.

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:17.470
The sound was from a two-legged
creature walking in the paddy field.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.880
In the mud?

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.150
Yes...

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:22.730
So what was it?

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.130
Are you really asking?!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:29.190
I saw...

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:34.890
I saw a shabby, unkempt mass fully covered in mud,
its two eyes the only things gleaming in the darkness.

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:41.280
Did you see it clearly?

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.780
Indeed, I believe it was...

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:53.870
the living dead creature known only as a zombie!

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:11.340
N-No way, this isn't a horror movie or virtual reality.

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:19.530
Actually, I have heard the underworld sometimes connects to ours and the dead creep out of it.

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:24.530
S-So what did you do, Mayu?

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:25.070
Well...

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:32.380
At first I couldn't help but be frightened and ran away.

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:43.630
But, for some reason, I got an urge to confirm what I saw.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:45.340
So you went back?

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.410
I did.

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:53.600
However, it was already gone.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:59.600
It disappeared into the dark of the night, only leaving behind footprints in the paddy field.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:07.960
Where did the footprints lead to?

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.320
Are you really asking?!

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.330
It went north. That is to say...

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.700
toward this shrine.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:31.370
Um, this has been bothering me for a while. Does anyone else smell something like fish?

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:35.060
I do. It smells like rotten fish.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.640
Th-These footsteps have to be...

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:50.810
Jeez, it suddenly started pouring. Today's just not my day.

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:52.910
Gonta, bring me a hand towel.

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.510
What's wrong?

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.910
M-Mother?!

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:59.010
Oh, it's just you, Shizuha.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:17:59.960
I thought—

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.670
—it was a zombie!

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:04.110
Huh, zombie?

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:07.000
You're just using the festival as an excuse to get free alcohol.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.550
Same goes for you!

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.350
How is it?

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:19.440
It's not quite there yet. The flavor is still lacking.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.590
Bring me that!

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:21.700
Yes, sir!

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:27.120
This is the god-given nam pla we got in the storm!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:30.170
We found it on the coast near Octopus Pot Inn, didn't we?

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:33.170
This smells very fishy.

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:35.930
The stench is excellent.

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:40.680
This is it! This is the taste!

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.640
This is from the God of Ramen!

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:45.270
Now we can make ramen with this and captivate the customers!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:51.610
The God of Ramen does guide people, doesn't he, President?

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.720
As I said, I no longer hold that title.

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:56.830
Actually, I think I'll change back to that title soon.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:19:00.510
My goal is to run a big chain and expand to the world!

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:03.170
I might become the Prime Minister or Mr. President!

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:06.210
You might rule the entire universe, President!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:09.000
Should I expand to the universe?

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:09.450
Yes!

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:10.420
And become the king?

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:13.480
What are they boiling in the stands outside?

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.670
Is this smell coming from the stands?

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:20.680
The rain's gone and the moon is bright.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.660
It was just a brief shower, then.

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:26.940
It cooled down thanks to the passing rain.

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:29.850
We can all sleep comfortably now.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.190
Mayu-sama, you too—

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:36.100
She's already asleep.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:38.330
I'm sure she was very tired.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:41.270
We should go to sleep too.

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:42.510
Let's do that.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:47.700
Yuzu-san.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.140
Let's drink under the moon, Shamo.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:51.630
You're walking too fast.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:54.740
Oh, the meat dumplings slipped.

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.190
Slip?!

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:57.960
I'm just hearing things again.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:06.640
It seems Mayu saw the Rice Field God at the festival last year.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.060
The God of Agriculture, eh?

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:14.480
Well, his job's more or less like an Inari's,
so he probably comes every year.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.020
She probably saw him around there.

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.780
Hm...

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:47.510
Sensei?

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:51.750
I'm the merciless sniper. I never miss my target.

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.850
Sounds like a catchphrase.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.400
Sensei, that's creepy.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:58.420
You're here, the rumored female sniper.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:01.530
I've prepared heavy metal monster statues so you can't take any.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.950
They're so heavy they won't move an—

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.780
That's one down.

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:09.040
How can this be?! I had confidence
in my heavy metal monster statues!

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:11.070
Sensei, we don't need things like that.

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:13.220
Yukina, come to your senses.

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:16.260
Here's two nam pla ramen!

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:16.260
What is this? It's great!

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:18.500
Please wait for your turn!

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.390
It smells like fish around here.

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:22.950
Mayu-sama, let's go goldfish scooping!

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:27.160
I'm the one who invited Mayu. Why are you coming along, Sasana?

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:32.420
Where is Mayu-sama? I wonder if she has enough money.

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:36.790
Yuzu-chan, I won the rock-paper-scissors
and got two of these, so you can have one.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:39.270
Oh, thank you, Haruka-san!

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.760
I'm all alone!

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:46.620
I lost everyone when I was buying cotton candy!

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:50.700
Oh well, fine, I'll have the cotton candy all to myself!

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:54.930
Hello, I'm the Rice Field God.

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:59.190
Dance, everyone, dance!

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:19.080
Let's all stand in a circle

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:19.080
(Yay, here we go!)

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:22.500
And let's all dance

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:22.500
(Join us!)

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:27.210
From far away beyond the mountain

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:27.210
(Oh let's go!)

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:30.510
Here come the cheerful gods

00:22:29.510 --> 00:22:31.240
(All right, festival time!)

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:35.240
There's a big party up in the heavens too

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:35.240
(Yeah, come on, come on!)

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:38.640
The round moon is smiling

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:38.640
(It's smiling)

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:42.590
Yes, it's a great day

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:46.970
Everyone freely enjoy the party

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:47.240
(Oh ho!)

00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:49.070
Thumpty-thump

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:49.230
(One more!)

00:22:49.230 --> 00:22:53.260
Everyone make cheer

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:53.660
(Sing, dance, and make noise a lot!)

00:22:53.660 --> 00:22:58.970
Come dance to Yaoyorozu Ondou

00:22:57.260 --> 00:23:00.710
(All right, let's keep going, thumpty-thump!)

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:05.130
Let's all stand in a circle

00:23:04.220 --> 00:23:05.130
(Yay, here we go!)

00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:08.740
And let's all dance

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:08.740
(Join us!)

00:23:09.130 --> 00:23:12.690
Let's all gather

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:13.040
(Oh yeah, it's a festival! All right!)

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:16.640
And let's all dance

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:16.640
(Oh yes, join us!)

00:23:17.300 --> 00:23:21.850
Ondou (or Ondo): A type of Japanese folk tune, often associated with the Bon festival dance, as featured in this ending.

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:41.370
Next Episode

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.990
Dance! Let's dance!

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:31.240
Are you all still feeling merry?

00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:33.450
Be quiet, the festival's over!

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:36.080
Gonta-san is more or less in the festive mood all year round!

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:38.460
This time we'll all be shrine maidens over at Gonta's?

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:41.370
Mukoubuchi Dice Roll

00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:40.850
Yes, Gonta's been rather lively as of late.
